 | Grokipedia</title><meta name="description" content="The Industrial Revolution denotes the transformative process of economic and technological change that originated in Great Britain during the mid-18th century, approximately from 1760 to 1840, shifting societies from agrarian and handicraft-based production to mechanized industry, factories, and machine manufacturing powered by water, steam, and later other innovations. This era began in Britain&#x27;s textile sector with inventions like James Hargreaves&#x27; spinning jenny in 1764, which enabled..."/><meta name="author" content="system"/><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/><meta name="keywords" content="First Industrial Revolution, IR"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"/><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow, max-snippet:-1"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://grokipedia.com/page/Industrial_Revolution"/><meta property="og:title" content="Industrial Revolution"/><meta property="og:description" content="The Industrial Revolution denotes the transformative process of economic and technological change that originated in Great Britain during the mid-18th century, approximately from 1760 to 1840, shifting societies from agrarian and handicraft-based production to mechanized industry, factories, and machine manufacturing powered by water, steam, and later other innovations. This era began in Britain&#x27;s textile sector with inventions like James Hargreaves&#x27; spinning jenny in 1764, which enabled..."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://grokipedia.com/page/Industrial_Revolution"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Grokipedia"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://grokipedia.com/icon-512x512.png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="512"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="512"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Industrial Revolution"/><meta property="og:type" content="article"/><meta property="article:modif